sequenceDiagram
    participant P as ComponentMigration.Process
    participant Prov as IMigrationProvider
    participant CF as ContainerFile
    participant SO as SerializedObject
    participant GO as GameObject
    participant Cache as FontAssetCache
    participant R as MigrationReport

    P->>Prov: Collect: Inspect(component, container, path) for every Component
    Prov-->>P: MigrationTarget (Kind, Values, Companions, Findings)
    P->>SO: CollectReferences: every ObjectReference field naming a target
    P->>CF: Severed: Read(container) for fields the file names and the object no longer holds
    P->>P: Withhold: drop targets whose referrer is declared too narrow (reference-would-break), regather
    P->>R: Add(target) for every target - if scan, return 0
    P->>P: Sort convertible by Rank: labels and meshes, then input fields, then dropdowns
    loop each convertible target
        P->>GO: Replace: DestroyImmediate(old), EnsureGraphicParts/EnsureRect, AddComponent new
        P->>Cache: Get(FontSourcePath) gives a OneFontAsset or a placeholder
        P->>SO: ApplyValues: write _text, _fontSize, _decoration ... by property path
        P->>P: replaced[oldInstanceId] = new component
    end
    loop each converted input field
        P->>SO: WireInputField: _textComponent/_placeholder via replaced map, _textViewport by id, CarryListeners
    end
    P->>SO: Relink: property.objectReferenceValue = replaced[OldId] - Update() - read back
    alt read-back holds the new component
        P->>R: Relinked++
    else field refused it
        P->>R: error dangling-reference
    end
    P-->>R: Converted += made.Count
